,{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"每個主要的區塊鏈都代表了不同的工程決策和取捨，這些決策受到我們所學的基本限制的影響。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":167},"end":{"line":7,"column":43,"offset":209}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":167},"end":{"line":7,"column":43,"offset":209}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Bitcoin","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":17,"offset":229},"end":{"line":9,"column":31,"offset":243}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"bitcoin","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":32,"offset":244},"end":{"line":9,"column":44,"offset":256}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":45,"offset":257},"end":{"line":9,"column":55,"offset":267}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":213},"end":{"line":9,"column":58,"offset":270}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"比特幣並不是為了成為通用計算機而設計的；它的目的是解決一個特定的問題：創建一種不依賴銀行或政府的數字貨幣。比特幣的每一個設計決策都反映了這一單一目標。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":274},"end":{"line":11,"column":76,"offset":349}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":274},"end":{"line":11,"column":76,"offset":349}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"共識機制","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":5,"offset":357},"end":{"line":13,"column":9,"offset":361}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":353},"end":{"line":13,"column":9,"offset":361}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"比特幣使用了中本聰設計的原始工作量證明（Proof of Work）實現。礦工競爭尋找一個隨機數（nonce），當這個數與區塊數據一起進行哈希運算時，會生成一個以特定數量的零開頭的哈希值。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":365},"end":{"line":15,"column":95,"offset":459}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":365},"end":{"line":15,"column":95,"offset":459}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"網絡每隔2,016個區塊（大約兩週）會自動調整難度，以保持平均區塊時